<title>SWITZERLAND: Nestle shares start firmer.</title>
<headline>Nestle shares start firmer.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nestle registered shares started firmer after the company said sales rose more than 7.1 percent in 1996 to 60.5 billion Swiss francs and forecast sales and profit would rise again in 1997.</p>
<p>Shares were up four Swiss francs to 1,473 at 0910 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
